{"hw":"ἐπειδάν","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">ἐπειδάν</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἐπειδάν</span>, i.e. <span class=\"gk\">ἐπειδὴ ἄν</span> (v. <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <span class=\"gk\">ἐπεί</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">A.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">11</span> </span>, <span class=\"gk\">ἄν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">B.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.2</span> </span> ), <b class=\"lex-tr\">whenever,</b> with Subj., of Time, once in <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hom.</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Il.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">13.285</span> </span>, freq. in <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Att.</span> </span> </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">2</span> for <span class=\"gk\">ἐπειδάν</span> c. opt. v. ἐπεί <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">A.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">111.5</span> </span>. [<span class=\"gk\">-αν</span> is prob.; <span class=\"gk\">ἐπεὶ δ' ἄν</span> is to be read in <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">A.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Th.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">734</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">E.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Rh.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">469</span> </span>.]</div></div>"}